  "deviations": [
    "Clip set: the brief names one loop (scrape_hide); per the batch-4 character rules (clips start/end on the r002 idle pose) scrape_enter and scrape_exit one-shots are added",
    "Placement anchors (frame_place, bundle_place, rack_place) are exported on person_hide.glb's rig root, and hide_frame.glb carries the inverse worker_place, so the station is defined from either side",
    "The drying rack is held to the frame's 500-triangle budget (the brief gives <=500 for the frame and <=150 for 'small' props; the rack is not small)",
    "Scraper contact is kept at 0.4-0.8 mm above the hide surface during the stroke (keys at +0.8 mm so interpolation never cuts in) and <= 12 mm on the return; the whole loop therefore stays within the brief's 20 mm",
    "Extra anchors beyond the brief: scrape_zone, hide_center, worker_place (frame); hang_point (rack); edge_mid, base_center (scraper); carry_grip, base_center (bundle)"
